What does this program print?

```dart
void main() {
  var count = 0;
  outer:
  for (var i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
    for (var j = 1; j <= 3; j++) {
      if (j == i) continue outer;
      count += 10 * i + j;
    }
  }
  print(count);
}
```

What does this program print?

```dart
int risky(int n) {
  if (n.isOdd) throw FormatException('odd');
  return n ~/ 2;
}

void main() {
  final out = <String>[];
  for (final n in [4, 3]) {
    try {
      out.add('${risky(n)}');
    } on FormatException {
      out.add('E');
    } finally {
      out.add('F');
    }
  }
  print(out.join());
}
```
